@host = http://localhost:5080

### A valid order: 201 Created
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "3f2b8a51-0c7e-4d0b-9a55-6c1d2e3f40e1",
  "email": "ann@example.com",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "TB-01", "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### One retired SKU: 409 with the code's declared type and title, and the entry's detail
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "3f2b8a51-0c7e-4d0b-9a55-6c1d2e3f40e1",
  "email": "ann@example.com",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "CH-12", "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### Several problems: 404 wins (403 > 404 > 409 > 422 > 400); every entry is listed under "errors"
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "email": "ann",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "CH-12", "quantity": 0 },
    { "sku": "CH-12", "quantity": 50 }
  ]
}
